            "answer": "B",
            "explanation": "【考点】There be句型的将来时。\n【解析】tomorrow afternoon表将来，There be的将来时是There will be或There is/are going to be。不能用have，因为there be和have不能混用。\n【There be各时态】①一般现在时：There is/are②一般过去时：There was/were③一般将来时：There will be / There is going to be④现在完成时：There have/has been。\n【易错点】There be不能与have混用！\"There will have\"是错误的。\n【排除】A(will have)there be与have混用，错误；C(is going to have)同样错误；D(has)一般现在时与tomorrow矛盾。",
